# Fixtures and contract

- Content lives in `fixtures/content/records` as @ui8kit/contract records (entries, dictionaries, menus, settings, manifest). Generate with `bun run content`; validate with `bun run contract` (0 errors, 0 warnings).
- Every media file is a `media` entry with `metadata.public_path` (served path) and `metadata.file` (repo path under fixtures/); apps copy them with `node tools/copy-media.mjs <dest>`.
- View models (`fixtures/views/*.json`) are derived from records by `tools/views.ts` — every runtime renders from the same JSON. Never hard-code copy in components.
- Figma extracts in `fixtures/figma/` are generated by fig2design and committed; the `.fig` source never is (`*.fig` is git-ignored). Never `git add -f` a `.fig`.
